{"id":"vod_bf_14286","vodId":"14286","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"花丸幼稚园","name_cn":"花丸幼稚园","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-15/4532ec24384887f23da290a1ce78d321.jpg"},"summary":"目前，超级宅男土田直纯（日野聪 配音）在一所名叫花丸的幼稚园中担任老师的职务，在可爱的小朋友们的围绕下，每天都过着充满欢笑的生活。在个性单纯直率的杏（真堂圭 配音）的眼中，土田老师是世界上最最优秀的男人，她无视巨大的年龄差距，发誓漫长的余生，非他不嫁。在好友小梅（樱井真子 配音）和柊（高垣彩阳 配音）的帮助下，杏锲而不舍的一次又一次向土田老师发动着恋爱进攻。　　可是，土田早就有了心上人——隔壁班的老师山本菜菜子（叶月絵理乃 配音）。不过，个性有些迟钝和天然呆的山本似乎对土田的心意没有半分察觉。在花丸幼稚园里，一出出轻松愉快的恋爱喜剧每一天都在上演着。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 03:34:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huawanyouzhiyuan/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:34.980Z"}